{"html":"<header class=\"spec-title-strip\">\n<div class=\"spec-title-col\">\n<div class=\"spec-family-crumb\">\n            FAMILY 11 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">物理约束重建：从后处理到展开优化与测量一致性</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Physics-Informed Recon</span>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"spec-model-title\" id=\"model_048_learned_primal_dual-title\">Learned Primal-Dual</h3>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-text lang-zh\">同时学习 measurement-domain dual 与 image-domain primal 更新，并在每个 unrolled stage 显式调用 A 和 A*。</p>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-en lang-en\">Unrolls primal–dual proximal optimization into K stages of paired measurement-domain (dual) and image-domain (primal) residual CNNs calling A and A* at every stage.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-tensor-col\">\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">INPUT DOMAIN // 输入域</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">测量 y、前向算子 A 与伴随算子 A*</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Raw tomographic measurements y, forward projection operator A, and adjoint backprojection operator A*</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">OUTPUT TARGET // 输出目标</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">K 级展开后的图像域 primal 重建 x_hat</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Reconstructed image x^{(K)} after K unrolled primal–dual iterations</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</header><div class=\"model-full-body\">\n<!-- Main Split: Original Figure Plate (Left) + Forward Computation Graph (Right) -->\n<div class=\"spec-blueprint-grid\">\n<section class=\"spec-figure-plate\">\n<div class=\"plate-header\">\n<div class=\"plate-header-left\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">PRIMARY FIGURE // Figure 2 · PDF p.7</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">论文原始架构图</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Original Paper Architecture Diagram</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"plate-header-right\">\n<a class=\"plate-source-link\" href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/1707.06474\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>SOURCE PDF</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n<button class=\"plate-zoom-btn\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_048_learned_primal_dual')\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6M9 21H3v-6M21 3l-7 7M3 21l7-7\"></path></svg><span>FULLSCREEN LIGHTBOX</span></button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"arch-figure-box\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_048_learned_primal_dual')\" title=\"Click to open interactive pan &amp; zoom viewer\">\n<img alt=\"Learned Primal-Dual original paper architecture figure, Figure 2\" class=\"arch-figure-img\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/98f0b4bc5845d159e8d6.avif\"/>\n<figcaption class=\"plate-caption\">CLICK FIGURE TO OPEN INTERACTIVE PAN &amp; ZOOM VIEWER · Figure 2 · PDF p.7</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</section>\n<aside class=\"spec-circuit-panel\">\n<div class=\"circuit-header\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">COMPUTATION GRAPH // 9 STAGES</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">架构前向计算节点拆解</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Forward Pass Computation Nodes</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"circuit-controls\">\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_048_learned_primal_dual', -1)\" title=\"Previous Stage\" type=\"button\">◁</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn circuit-play-btn\" data-play-id=\"architecture_model_048_learned_primal_dual\" data-call-click=\"toggleAutoPlayNodes('architecture_model_048_learned_primal_dual')\" title=\"Auto-Trace Computation Graph\" type=\"button\">AUTO</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_048_learned_primal_dual', 1)\" title=\"Next Stage\" type=\"button\">▷</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"active-node-spotlight\" id=\"spotlight-architecture_model_048_learned_primal_dual\">\n<span class=\"spotlight-badge\">\n                STAGE 01 / 09 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">测量 y</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Stage 01</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text lang-zh\">CT sinogram 等 measurement-domain 数据</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text spotlight-text-en lang-en\">Ingests raw tomographic measurements y, forward projection operator a, and adjoint backprojection operator a* and prepares initial tensor representations (Stage 01).</span>\n</div>\n<ol class=\"circuit-timeline\">\n<li class=\"circuit-node active\" data-node-desc=\"CT sinogram 等 measurement-domain 数据\" data-node-desc-en=\"Ingests raw tomographic measurements y, forward projection operator a, and adjoint backprojection operator a* and prepares initial tensor representations (Stage 01).\" data-node-idx=\"0\" data-node-name=\"测量 y\" data-node-name-en=\"Stage 01\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_048_learned_primal_dual', 0)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">01</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">测量 y</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Stage 01</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">CT sinogram 等 measurement-domain 数据</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Ingests raw tomographic measurements y, forward projection operator a, and adjoint backprojection operator a* and prepares initial tensor representations (Stage 01).</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"多通道图像域记忆；首通道最终作为重建\" data-node-desc-en=\"Executes Primal h_k to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.\" data-node-idx=\"1\" data-node-name=\"Primal h_k\" data-node-name-en=\"Primal h_k\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_048_learned_primal_dual', 1)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">02</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Primal h_k</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">多通道图像域记忆；首通道最终作为重建</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Executes Primal h_k to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"把当前 primal 图像投影到测量域\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs A within the core unrolled primal dual reconstruction computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"2\" data-node-name=\"A\" data-node-name-en=\"A\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_048_learned_primal_dual', 2)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">03</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>A</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">把当前 primal 图像投影到测量域</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs A within the core unrolled primal dual reconstruction computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"多通道测量域记忆，保留历史残差与特征\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Dual f_k within the core unrolled primal dual reconstruction computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"3\" data-node-name=\"Dual f_k\" data-node-name-en=\"Dual f_k\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_048_learned_primal_dual', 3)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">04</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Dual f_k</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">多通道测量域记忆，保留历史残差与特征</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Dual f_k within the core unrolled primal dual reconstruction computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"f_{k+1}=Gamma_{theta_k}(f_k,A(h_k),y)\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Dual update within the core unrolled primal dual reconstruction computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"4\" data-node-name=\"Dual 更新\" data-node-name-en=\"Dual update\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_048_learned_primal_dual', 4)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">05</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">Dual 更新</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Dual update</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">f_{k+1}=Gamma_{theta_k}(f_k,A(h_k),y)</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Dual update within the core unrolled primal dual reconstruction computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"把更新后的 dual 特征反投影回图像域\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs A* within the core unrolled primal dual reconstruction computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"5\" data-node-name=\"A*\" data-node-name-en=\"A*\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_048_learned_primal_dual', 5)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">06</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>A*</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">把更新后的 dual 特征反投影回图像域</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs A* within the core unrolled primal dual reconstruction computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"h_{k+1}=Lambda_{theta_k}(h_k,A*(f_{k+1}))\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Primal update within the core unrolled primal dual reconstruction computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"6\" data-node-name=\"Primal 更新\" data-node-name-en=\"Primal update\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_048_learned_primal_dual', 6)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">07</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">Primal 更新</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Primal update</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">h_{k+1}=Lambda_{theta_k}(h_k,A*(f_{k+1}))</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Primal update within the core unrolled primal dual reconstruction computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"每级显式经过 A、dual update、A*、primal update\" data-node-desc-en=\"Applies K unrolled to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.\" data-node-idx=\"7\" data-node-name=\"K 级展开\" data-node-name-en=\"K unrolled\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_048_learned_primal_dual', 7)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">08</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">K 级展开</span><span class=\"lang-en\">K unrolled</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">每级显式经过 A、dual update、A*、primal update</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Applies K unrolled to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"读取最终 primal 状态的图像通道\" data-node-desc-en=\"Produces reconstructed image x^{(k)} after k unrolled primal–dual iterations via x_hat.\" data-node-idx=\"8\" data-node-name=\"x_hat\" data-node-name-en=\"x_hat\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_048_learned_primal_dual', 8)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">09</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>x_hat</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">读取最终 primal 状态的图像通道</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Produces reconstructed image x^{(k)} after k unrolled primal–dual iterations via x_hat.</span></div></li>\n</ol>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<!-- Mathematical Formalism Band -->\n<section aria-label=\"Learned Primal-Dual Mathematical Formalism\" class=\"spec-math-band\">\n<div class=\"math-meta-col\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">MATHEMATICAL FORMALISM</span>\n<div class=\"math-title-text lang-zh\">核心公式 · 展开式 primal–dual 双域更新</div>\n<div class=\"math-title-en lang-en\">Core Formalism · Coupled Primal (Image) &amp; Dual (Sinogram) Learned Proximal Updates Calling A and A*</div>\n</div>\n<div aria-label=\"Learned Primal-Dual：核心公式 · 展开式 primal–dual 双域更新\" class=\"tex-formula-vector\" role=\"img\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"