4031-2.232723 3.05157-2.2491L3.046111-2.336444H1.828759L1.834218-2.2491H1.959774C2.139921-2.2491 2.232723-2.210887 2.232723-2.145379C2.232723-2.0362 1.910643-1.774169 1.266484-1.386581L.977158-1.206435L1.648612-3.701189L1.566728-3.728484C1.157304-3.657517 .900732-3.619304 .485849-3.581091L.491308-3.493748H.616865C.867978-3.493748 .988076-3.455535 1.004452-3.357273C.998994-3.264471 .955322-3.122537 .873437-2.865965L.824306-2.685819L.807929-2.636688L.098262 0H.655078L.917109-.982617L1.200976-1.157304C1.326532-.917109 1.539433-.578652 1.670448-.387588C1.916102-.043672 2.030741 .060049 2.232723 .060049C2.500213 .060049 2.669442-.076426 2.94785-.53498Z\" id=\"m048_g10-58\"></path></defs><g id=\"m048_page1\"><use x=\"-67.277715\" xlink:href=\"#m048_g16-53\" y=\"-61.587574\"></use><use x=\"-64.0812\" xlink:href=\"#m048_g13-58\" y=\"-60.093193\"></use><use x=\"-60.084847\" xlink:href=\"#m048_g4-184\" y=\"-60.093193\"></use><use x=\"-55.459393\" xlink:href=\"#m048_g20-49\" y=\"-60.093193\"></use><use x=\"-48.55759\" xlink:href=\"#m048_g1-61\" y=\"-61.587574\"></use><use x=\"-39.254765\" xlink:href=\"#m048_g1-0\" y=\"-61.587574\"></use><use x=\"-33.014671\" xlink:href=\"#m048_g13-92\" y=\"-60.093193\"></use><use x=\"-29.197183\" xlink:href=\"#m048_g10-58\" y=\"-58.960387\"></use><use x=\"-24.37129\" xlink:href=\"#m048_g7-185\" y=\"-61.602517\"></use><use x=\"-18.921735\" xlink:href=\"#m048_g16-53\" y=\"-61.587574\"></use><use x=\"-15.72522\" xlink:href=\"#m048_g13-58\" y=\"-60.093193\"></use><use x=\"-11.230746\" xlink:href=\"#m048_g16-150\" y=\"-61.587574\"></use><use x=\"-6.222916\" xlink:href=\"#m048_g16-22\" y=\"-61.587574\"></use><use x=\".352417\" xlink:href=\"#m048_g16-17\" y=\"-61.587574\"></use><use x=\"5.860259\" xlink:href=\"#m048_g13-58\" y=\"-60.093193\"></use><use x=\"10.354732\" xlink:href=\"#m048_g16-150\" y=\"-61.587574\"></use><use x=\"15.013871\" xlink:href=\"#m048_g16-72\" y=\"-61.587574\"></use><use x=\"19.815862\" xlink:href=\"#m048_g7-186\" y=\"-61.602517\"></use><use x=\"25.291897\" xlink:href=\"#m048_g16-150\" y=\"-61.587574\"></use><use x=\"39.873829\" xlink:href=\"#m048_g16-17\" y=\"-61.587574\"></use><use x=\"45.38167\" xlink:href=\"#m048_g13-58\" y=\"-60.093193\"></use><use x=\"49.378023\" xlink:href=\"#m048_g4-184\" y=\"-60.093193\"></use><use x=\"54.003477\" xlink:href=\"#m048_g20-49\" y=\"-60.093193\"></use><use x=\"60.90528\" xlink:href=\"#m048_g1-61\" y=\"-61.587574\"></use><use x=\"70.008848\" xlink:href=\"#m048_g1-3\" y=\"-61.587574\"></use><use x=\"77.69353\" xlink:href=\"#m048_g13-92\" y=\"-60.093193\"></use><use x=\"81.511017\" xlink:href=\"#m048_g10-58\" y=\"-58.960387\"></use><use x=\"86.33691\" xlink:href=\"#m048_g7-185\" y=\"-61.602517\"></use><use x=\"90.411626\" xlink:href=\"#m048_g16-17\" y=\"-61.587574\"></use><use x=\"95.919467\" xlink:href=\"#m048_g13-58\" y=\"-60.093193\"></use><use x=\"100.413941\" xlink:href=\"#m048_g16-150\" y=\"-61.587574\"></use><use x=\"105.421771\" xlink:href=\"#m048_g16-22\" y=\"-61.587574\"></use><use x=\"111.638447\" xlink:href=\"#m048_g4-3\" y=\"-65.702134\"></use><use x=\"117.295524\" xlink:href=\"#m048_g16-53\" y=\"-61.587574\"></use><use x=\"120.492039\" xlink:href=\"#m048_g13-58\" y=\"-60.093193\"></use><use x=\"124.488392\" xlink:href=\"#m048_g4-184\" y=\"-60.093193\"></use><use x=\"129.113846\" xlink:href=\"#m048_g20-49\" y=\"-60.093193\"></use><use x=\"133.248316\" xlink:href=\"#m048_g7-186\" y=\"-61.602517\"></use></g></svg>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- 5-Column Swiss Specification Matrix -->\n<div class=\"spec-evo-matrix\">\n<div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-bottleneck\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">01 // PRIOR LIMITATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">上一代瓶颈</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">仅在图像域学习 proximal 难利用 sinogram/k-space 结构</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Image-domain post-processing discards sinogram residuals, while hand-crafted TV primal–dual algorithms require ratusan iterations and produce patchy cartoons.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-idea\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">02 // CORE HYPOTHESIS</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">核心想法</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">在展开迭代中同时学习 measurement-domain dual 与 image-domain primal 更新</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Replace both the dual proximal operator in measurement space and the primal proximal operator in image space with small multi-channel residual CNNs across K≈10 stages.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-improvement\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">03 // ARCHITECTURAL DELTA</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">关键改进</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">每个 stage 显式调用 A 与 A*，保留 measurement residual</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Explicitly embeds forward operator A and adjoint A* inside every unrolled layer with multi-channel memory states in both primal and dual spaces.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-adaptation\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">04 // MEDICAL TRANSLATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">医学适配</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">在 CT 上建立网络作为可解释优化算法的范式</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Established the gold-standard paradigm for physics-informed unrolled CT and tomographic reconstruction.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-evidence\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">05 // EVIDENCE &amp; BOUNDARY</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">适用范围与证据</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">仍值得复现；3D projector、operator mismatch 与内存是限制</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Strong measurement-consistent baseline; requires storing K stages of 2D/3D activations during backpropagation and accurate projector calibration.</p></div>\n</div>\n<!-- 2-Column Design Principles & Medical Translation Band -->\n<div class=\"spec-dual-band\">\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">ARCHITECTURAL AXIOMS // 设计原理与数学机制</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">把一阶 primal-dual 优化算法展开为固定深度网络，使每级更新都有明确的测量域和图像域角色。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">A 与 A* 在每级中保持显式，网络学习的是更新规则，而不是重新学习成像几何。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">多通道 primal/dual memory 比单一图像迭代能携带更丰富的历史状态，但也增加显存。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Core Hypothesis: Replace both the dual proximal operator in measurement space and the primal proximal operator in image space with small multi-channel residual CNNs across K≈10 stages.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Architectural Delta: Explicitly embeds forward operator A and adjoint A* inside every unrolled layer with multi-channel memory states in both primal and dual spaces.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Mathematical Formalism: Coupled Primal (Image) &amp; Dual (Sinogram) Learned Proximal Updates Calling A and A*.</li></ul>\n</section>\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">CLINICAL TRANSLATION &amp; BOUNDARIES // 医学应用与安全边界</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">在 CT 等线性投影系统中，可直接把校准后的 projector/backprojector 嵌入训练和推理。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">算子失配、散射或运动会让所谓数据一致性对错误物理一致；3D 展开还受 projector 计算和显存限制。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Clinical Translation: Established the gold-standard paradigm for physics-informed unrolled CT and tomographic reconstruction.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Evidence &amp; Safety Boundary: Strong measurement-consistent baseline; requires storing K stages of 2D/3D activations during backpropagation and accurate projector calibration.</li></ul>\n</section>\n</div>\n<!-- Provenance Footer Bar -->\n<footer class=\"spec-footer-bar\">\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">PRIMARY LITERATURE // 原始文献</span>\n<a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/1707.06474\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n<span>Learned Primal-Dual Reconstruction</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg>\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">OFFICIAL IMPLEMENTATION // 开源代码</span>\n<a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://github.com/adler-j/learned_primal_dual\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>作者/机构官方实现</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n</div>\n</footer>\n</div>"}
